<title>USA: National Securities declares stock dividend.</title>
<headline>National Securities declares stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE, Wash. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Securities Corp said it declared a five perent stock dividend to be paid February 10 to shareholders of record January 27.</p>
<p>It said fractional shares will be rounded up.</p>
</text>
